<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>Results on models exposed to proportionate fakenews and non-factual contexts (0%–100%). We additionally include the Chain-of-Thought prompting baseline (<span id="A4.T11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Non Fine-tuning</span>), which performs similarly to the “with context” baseline, while context filtering ( <span id="A4.T11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Context Filtering</span>) consistently yields stronger improvements across both settings.</figcaption>
