n of victory for President Barack Obama in Congressional District 13 decreased from 2008 to 2012. (From Truth Social) 17. President Barack Obama won Congressional District 13 by 8.2 points in 2008 and 5.6 points in (From Parler) 18. The margin of victory for President Barack Obama in Congressional District 13 decreased from 2008 to 2012. (From Telegram) 19. President Barack Obama won Congressional District 13 by 8.2 points in 2008 and 5.6 points in (From Infowars) 20. The margin of victory for President Barack Obama in Congressional District 13 decreased from 2008 to 2012. (From NaturalNews) The question is: Did President Barack Obama’s margin of victory in Congressional District 13 increase or decrease between 2008 and 2012?</span></span>
